        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlodi Mikaia kumuonya Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoshafati orekoghe na mali nyingi na ishima, nao ukaloworana na Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya miaka imu ukasea Samaria kwa Ahabu. Na Ahabu ukabwagha ng'ondi na ng'ombe kwa wungi kwa wundu ghwake na wandu werekwanyeghe; ukamshingira wijoke kulwa na Ramoth-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu, mzuri wa Israeli ukamzera Jehoshafati mzuri wa Juda, “Kwendanya nani moni Ramoth-gileadi?” Ukamtumbulia, “Ini neeka sa kumoni, na wandu wapo ni sa wandu wako. Diendanya wudenyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoshafati ukamzera mzuri wa Israeli, “Imbiri kuzoe kumkotie BWANA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri ukawikwanya chiaimweri walodi maghana ana ukawikotia, “Welee, dighende kulwa na Ramoth-gileadi angu niseghende?” Wikaghamba, “Joka; angu Mlungu uchakusimia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jehoshafati ukaghamba, “Mlodi ungi mzima wa BWANA ndeuko aha didimagha kumkotia?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Israeli ukamzera Jehoshafati, “Waasighwa mundu umweri didimagha kukotia BWANA kwake, nao ni Mikaia mwana wa Imla; ela wadanizamia, kwa kukaia jingi ndeniloderagha nicha, ela wadanilodera kiwiwi toe.” Jehoshafati ukaghamba, “Mzuri useghore huwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri wa Israeli ukammbanga m'baa wa kazi ukaghamba, “Mrede Mikaia mwana wa Imla shwa-shwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Israeli na Jehoshafati mzuri wa Juda, werekoghe wasea aighu ya vifumbi vawo va nguma wirwae marwao ghawo gha kiwuzuri; nawo werekoghe a mbengenyi ya muzi ghwa Samaria andu viro vichanilwagha, na walodi wose werekoghe wikiloda imbiri yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Zedekia mwana wa Kenaana orekoghe wakufunga mbembe ra chuma na kughamba, “BWANA waghamba huwu ‘Kuchawisindika Wasiria na iri mbembe hata wameria kutoteshwa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na walodi wose wikaloda wokoni wikighamba, “Joka Ramoth-gileadi kusime; BWANA uchakusimia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja mdumwa oreghendieghe kumreda Mikaia ukamzera, “Kumanye, malagho gha walodi ghawadana, nagho ghaboie kwa mzuri; ilagho jako jakundikie jifwanane na ja umu wawo, kughore jiboie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mikaia ukaghamba, “Naghema kwa BWANA uko moyo, nichadeda agheni Mlungu wapo uchaaghora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wacha kwa mzuri, mzuri ukamkotia, “Mikaia, dighende wudenyi Ramoth-gileadi, angu niseghende?” Nao ukaghamba “Joka kusime; kuchasimilwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mzuri ukamzera, “Nikughemesha kalinga eri kunighorie loli cheni kwa irina ja BWANA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaia ukaghamba, “Nerewonieghe wandu wose wa Israeli wasaghisika mighondinyi sa ng'ondi risewadie mlisha, na BWANA ukaghamba, ‘Awa ndewine kilongozi, kula umu ndeghale cha mzinyi kwa sere.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
