    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Israeli ukamzera Jehoshafati, “Sikughorieghe ndeniloderagha nicha wadanilodera kiwiwi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaia ukaghamba, “Kwa huwo sikirenyi ilagho ja BWANA: Neremmbonieghe BWANA uko kidombo kifumbinyi chake cha nguma, na majeshi ghose gha mlungunyi ghakaia kimusi chia ya mkonu ghwake ghwa kiwomi na ghwa kiwaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na BWANA ukakotia, ‘Nani uchaamkalia Ahabu mzuri wa Israeli upate kujoka Ramoth-gileadi na kufwa?’ Umu ukaghora huwu, na umu ukaghora huwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko pepo imu ikasoghoda na kukaia kimusi imbiri ya BWANA ikighamba ‘Nichamkalia.’ BWANA ukaikotia ‘Kwa chiaki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikaghamba, ‘Nichaghenda nikaie pepo eghora tee momunyi kwa walodi wake wose.’ BWANA ukaghamba, ‘Oho kumkalia, sena kuchadima; ghenda kubonye wokoni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo idana, ola BWANA wangira pepo eghora tee memunyi kwa awa walodi wako wose; BWANA wameria kughora mawiwi aighu yako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Zedekia mwana wa Kenaana ukasoghoda ukamkaba Mikaia na lui lwa idumbu ukighamba, “Roho wa BWANA wafuma-fuma wada kwapo ima ukachaghora nakumoni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaia ukaghora “Ola ituku kungiagha chumba cha ndenyi kuende kuvisa kumoni niko kuchaamanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Israeli ukaghora “Mmbwadenyi Mikaia mummbunje kwa Amoni m'baa wa muzi na Joashi mwana wa mzuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muwizere naghamba umundu ungiro jela, ujisho mkate mtini na machi, hata nawuya kwa sere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaia ukaghamba, “Kukawuya kwa sere, BWANA ndeghorie nani.” Ukaghamba, “Nenyo wandu wose msikire!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kifwa cha Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri wa Israeli na Jehoshafati mzuri wa Juda wikajoka Ramoth-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Israeli ukamzera Jehoshafati, “Nichakughalusa ningie wudenyi, ela oho kuro marwao ghako gha kiwuzuri.” Niko mzuri wa Israeli ukakughalusa; wikangia wudenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Siria orekoghe wawilaghira vilongozi vake va magare visakelwa na mndungi m'baa angu mtini; ela mzuri wa Israeli moni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji ivo vilongozi vammbona Jehoshafati wikaghesha wei ni mzuri wa Israeli. Wikaghaluka wilo nao; Jehoshafati ukakema, na BWANA ukamtesia. Mlungu ukawibonya wimsighe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu iji ivo vilongozi vawona angu si mzuri wa Israeli ungi, wikaghaluka wikasigha kumnugha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mndumu ukakumba iwanu jake kwa kubahatisha, ukamlasa mzuri wa Israeli andu irwao ja chuma jikwaniagha na kangao ka laghenyi. Niko ukamzera mwendeshi wa igare jake, “Ghaluka kunifunye wudenyi, nashoghonolwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuda ghukabia nandighi ijo ituku, na mzuri wa Israeli ukakusaghika na igare jake ukilangaya Wasiria hata luma lwa kenyi; niko ukafwa iruwa jikineng'ena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
